odities. The implemented }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 two-layer architecture}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 
 uses aligned sentiment-market inputs to estimate }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 GARCH(1,1)-based volatility features}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 , then applies a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 statistical Jump Model (JM)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid2847553 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 
