\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sa240\sl276\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid9712292 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9712292\charrsid9712292 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 
The rise of large language models (LLMs) has improved financial sentiment analysis, especially through zero-\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 shot and few-\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 shot learning frameworks. Fatouros et al. (2023) evaluated ChatGPT 3.
\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 5 for FX market sentiment assessment, noting approximately 35% higher sentiment classification accuracy and 36% greater correlation with market returns }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9712292 
\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 than}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs24\insrsid9712292\charrsid9712292 \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0  the domain-\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 adapted FinBERT. Their zero-\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 
