 prediction system that combines half-hourly sentiment from stock message boards with three-minute stock return forecasts. Their approach used the RR-MIDAS (Reverse Restricted Mixed Data Sampling) f\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 
ramework together with Ensemble Empirical Mode Decomposition to handle non-stationarity and mixed-frequency dynamics. The system achieved maximum reductions of 19.18% in MAE, 19.08% in RMSE, and 11.71% in SMAPE compared to traditional methods. Importantly
\hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 , \hich\af0\dbch\af31501\loch\f0 they showed that sentiment impacts high-frequency returns across seven intraday periods, with influence gradually fading over time. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
